          "Anchor constituent communication in economic specifics — manufacturing jobs, agricultural viability, infrastructure investment — that speak to working-class homeowners whose wealth is tied to property and community stability, not portfolio returns.",
          "Acknowledge and provide constituent service to the small but present non-white minority population (~7.3% combined, with a likely AIAN gap of ~3.7%); invisible minority communities in homogeneous districts are the ones most likely to organize opposition when they conclude their representative is governing for someone else."
