          "Lead on working-class economic security with specificity: at $50,584 median income and 17.6% college attainment, the district's households are acutely exposed to rural hospital closures, workforce displacement, and infrastructure gaps — concrete policy wins on these issues are the currency of durable incumbency at this margin.",
