          "Lead with working-class economic security: at 16.9% college attainment and $53,616 household income, the district's majority constituency is acutely sensitive to wages, healthcare costs, and housing affordability — any candidate who cannot speak to these concerns with specificity is leaving the district's economic center unaddressed.",
