          "Do not assume that unopposed 2023 creates a safe 2025 or 2027: in a district with $60,361 median income, 33.7% renters, and 20.4% college attainment under economic pressure, the voters are evaluating whether their representative is delivering material improvement in their economic circumstances — not voting based on inherited partisan loyalty or previous cycle results."
