          "Understand that 26% college attainment is the lowest signal in this sequence: community college funding, apprenticeship programs, and vocational education pathways are not abstract issues but direct economic concerns for three-quarters of the adult population—any candidate who can speak to workforce development with specificity rather than generic education rhetoric demonstrates genuine understanding of the district's constraints."
