          "Lead with material quality-of-life delivery: the $63,688 median income and 33% renter rate identify a constituency managing real housing costs, healthcare expenses, and job security — focus on what the incumbent has actually delivered on these issues and what a new representative would prioritize differently.",
          "Build a neighborhood-level organizational presence that the incumbent may have assumed was unnecessary: door-to-door constituent listening on school quality, police effectiveness, healthcare access, and small-business support will establish credibility that an unopposed incumbent may have neglected to develop.",
          "Engage the 27.6% college-educated constituency on education quality and workforce pipeline issues; this subgroup is likely decision-making within the district's professional and managerial classes and is amenable to evaluation on specific education and economic development policy."
