          "Lead with material economic security for the working-class homeowner majority: at $71,413 median income with rising healthcare costs and property tax pressure, this constituency evaluates on whether government is delivering practical relief — not abstract messaging; property tax policy, rural healthcare access, and utility cost management are the issues that activate engagement.",
          "Engage the ~2.2% AIAN gap population directly and measure their preferences in any future election — tribal water rights, healthcare access, and economic development are the leverage points for mobilizing this constituency, and their turnout in a competitive race could shift a 10-15 point margin meaningfully; do not assume this population is captured by the white homeowner Republican base.",
