          "Lead with homeowner economic security: property tax fairness, rural healthcare viability, and cost-of-living pressures for a $54,579-income, 82.5%-homeowner constituency are the material concerns most likely to drive opposition in the next competitive cycle. Demonstrate specific legislative responsiveness on property tax burden and rural service delivery.",
