          "Lead incumbent strategy with concrete renter-constituency delivery: housing cost controls, tenant protections, residential zoning reform, and affordable housing development are not ideological positions in a district where 46.3% of households are renter-vulnerable. These are the material governance issues that determine whether a working-class urban constituency sees government as serving their interests or representing someone else's.",
