          "Develop specific legislative answers to healthcare access and cost concerns for the 48.3-year median-age constituency, particularly Medicare sustainability, rural healthcare viability, and prescription drug affordability; economic anxiety among older fixed-income households is a plausible driver of the 21% opposition and a vulnerability point if unaddressed.",
