          "Engage the 20.39% Black population with specific attention to middle-class suburban concerns: education quality, equitable city services, property values, and healthcare access are the material governance issues for a college-educated, $76,938-income Black constituency that will evaluate on competence and delivery, not assumed partisan loyalty.",
