          "Invest in constituent infrastructure and service delivery: with limited college attainment (20.9%) and severe income constraint ($33,838), constituents depend on representative-level assistance navigating government services, benefits access, and economic advocacy; outpost hours, responsive casework, and visible economic leadership are the foundation of the durable constituent relationship."
