          "Lead with tangible delivery on working-family economic security: $43,148 median income and 40.8% renter rate mean constituents are evaluating whether government is materially improving their lives — affordable housing access, job creation, school quality, and public safety are the concrete concerns that drive turnout and loyalty, not abstract Democratic messaging.",
